{'symbol': 'ILMN', 'date': '2022-05-12 11:00:00', 'title': 'COMPREHENSIVE STUDY ESTABLISHES COST OF LATE DETECTION AND TREATMENT OF CANCER', 'text': 'AN ANALYSIS OF 2 MILLION MEDICARE BENEFICIARIES ESTABLISHES THE COST OF CANCER BY STAGE AND TIME SINCE DIAGNOSIS FOR 17 COMMON CANCERS. THE LATER THE STAGE AT DIAGNOSIS, THE HIGHER THE COST, AND THIS COST DIFFERENCE LASTS FOR AT LEAST FIVE YEARS AFTER DIAGNOSIS.'}